@page "/"

<PageTitle>Car Price Predictor</PageTitle>

<h1>Welcome to Car Price Predictor</h1>

<p>
    This application combines Machine Learning and AI to help you navigate the used car market with confidence. Choose one of our tools below to get started:
</p>

<div class="row mt-4">
    <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h3 class="card-title">
                    <span class="oi oi-calculator" aria-hidden="true"></span> Price Prediction
                </h3>
                <p class="card-text">
                    Determine if a car's asking price is fair. Enter the car details (or quickly auto-fill them using our VIN decoder) and the asking price, and we'll tell you if it's:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Too High</strong> - The asking price is above market value</li>
                    <li><strong>Good Price</strong> - The asking price is within fair market range</li>
                    <li><strong>Too Low</strong> - The asking price is below market value</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="/predict" class="btn btn-primary mt-auto">Start Price Check</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h3 class="card-title">
                    <span class="bi bi-search-heart-fill" aria-hidden="true"></span> Find My Car
                </h3>
                <p class="card-text">
                    Not sure what to buy? Our AI-powered recommendation wizard helps you find the perfect car based on your budget, preferred body style, and requirements.
                </p>
                <ol>
                    <li>Set your budget and constraints</li>
                    <li>Choose your preferred powertrain and comfort hints</li>
                    <li>Let Gemini AI and our ML model find your best matches</li>
                </ol>
                <a href="/recommend" class="btn btn-success mt-auto">Find My Car</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<h3>How it works</h3>
<ol>
    <li>Enter the car's make, model, year, mileage, fuel type, and other details</li>
    <li>Enter the asking price you're considering</li>
    <li>Our ML model analyzes the data against thousands of car listings</li>
    <li>Get instant feedback on the price and see the typical price range</li>
</ol>
